<article class="env-lemma" id="0FLH">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FLH">Lemma <span data-tag="0FLH">20.25.2</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a ringed space. Let $\mathcal{U} : X = \bigcup _{i \in I} U_ i$ be an open covering. Let $\mathcal{F}^\bullet $ be a bounded below complex of $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules. If $H^ i(U_{i_0 \ldots i_ p}, \mathcal{F}^ q) = 0$ for all $i > 0$ and all $p, i_0, \ldots , i_ p, q$, then the map $ \text{Tot}(\check{\mathcal{C}}^\bullet (\mathcal{U}, \mathcal{F}^\bullet )) \to R\Gamma (X, \mathcal{F}^\bullet ) $ of Lemma <a href="/tag/08BN" data-tag="08BN">20.25.1</a> is an isomorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from the spectral sequence of Lemma <a href="/tag/08BN" data-tag="08BN">20.25.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>